request.description:
Register a push notification device token (Firebase FCM or Apple APNs).

Request body (Map<String,String>):
- deviceToken: String (required) — FCM or APNs device token
- platform: String (optional, default: FCM) — FCM | APNs

Response 200: { deviceArn: String (AWS SNS ARN), platform: String, registeredAt: Instant }
Response 400: { error: 'MISSING_DEVICE_TOKEN' }
